          "summary": "<p>财新网09月23日电:沪指开盘报3951.37点，跌幅0.02%。</p><p>深成指报13742.55点，涨幅0.14%；创业板指报3412.53点，涨幅0.37%；中小板指报8439.13点，跌幅0.07%。</p><p>盘面上，电子领涨，有色金属、综合、通信、社会服务、机械设备等板块涨幅居前，建筑材料领跌，传媒、煤炭、交通运输、石油石化、银行等走弱。</p><p>消息面上，习近平于9月23日至25日对美国进行国事访问；伊朗外长与美特使在纽约会晤，特朗普表示美伊代表会谈“非常有建设性”；李强在上海调研时强调，加快培育壮大新兴产业和未来产业；阿里平头哥发布AI芯片真武V900，算力达M890三倍；小米首发第六代骁龙8超级至尊版；中金公司A股今日开市起复牌‌。</p><p>撰写：财小智   责编：财小新</p><div class=\"yqzszb\" id=\"yqzszb\"><div class=\"header\"><div class=\"yqzszb-title\"><strong><span>上市公司敏感舆情指数</span></strong><img alt=\"数据+\" class=\"support\" src=\"https://entities.caixin.com/support.png\" /></div><p><em class=\"update-time\">更新时间：2026-09-23</em></p></div><div class=\"yqzszb-list\"><div class=\"list-header\"><div class=\"order\">排名</div><div class=\"others\"><div class=\"stock\">股票</div><div class=\"index\">今日指数</div><div class=\"comp\">较昨日</div></div></div><ul class=\"yqzszb-lists\"><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101002593\"><div class=\"row-order\">1</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101002593\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">洪城环境<p><span class=\"stock-no\">600461.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">6.24</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+6.24</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">洪城环境董事副总经理曹名帅年薪42.24万元是公司人均薪酬的2.67倍，71天减持100股套现884元</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101020212\"><div class=\"row-order\">2</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101020212\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">智新电子<p><span class=\"stock-no\">920212.BJ</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">4.09</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+4.09</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">智新电子董事赵庆福年薪183.91万元是公司人均薪酬的18.49倍，1天减持4万股套现43万元</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.ca